            "text": "<p><strong>Up to 80% off clearance items | 15% off everything else!*</strong></p><p>Introducing our biggest Year End Sale! Join us on <strong>Thursday, 7 November</strong> to get a first look at our incredible deals, all before the crowds arrive – a perfect opportunity be amongst the first to shop our bargains in a relaxed setting.</p><p><strong>When: </strong>Thursday, 7 November</p><p><strong>Time: </strong>11am-7pm</p><p><strong>Where: </strong>8 Kaki Bukit Avenue, #06-03/04, Singapore 417941</p><p>If you can't make it in person, we have a selection of clearance items available online from 12.01am, Thursday 7 November.</p><p>We hope to see you there!</p>",
